  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CLIMB - Conservation Livelihoods in Malawi&apos;s Biospheres</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is improving livelihoods and conservation management in two forested areas of Malawi (Mount Mulanje and South Viphya) working with two Malawi partners and Earthwatch UK to deliver technical monitoring or agricultural activities alongside the conservation efforts</narrative>
